From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] appxpackaging: Bundle writer, IAppxPackageWriter2/3 (6060)

IAppxBundleFactory::CreateBundleWriter gave E_NOTIMPL. A bundle writer
stores its payload packages, writes AppxMetadata\AppxBundleManifest.xml
(the bundle's identity from its packages; each package's type,
architecture, resource ID, languages, offset and size), the block map and
the content types. IAppxBundleWriter3/4 add package references (listed
without an offset, not stored) and Close with a hash method; external
package references are not written yet (E_NOTIMPL). The package writer
gains IAppxPackageWriter2 (Close with a content group map) and
IAppxPackageWriter3 (AddPayloadFiles). The bundle reader accepts a
referenced package that is not in the bundle.
---
